<h1 class="sectionedit1" id="jiri_milicka">Jiří Milička</h1>
<div class="level1">
<ul>
<li class="level1"><div class="li"><a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?hl=en&amp;user=71SLjBMAAAAJ" class="urlextern" target="_blank" title="https://scholar.google.com/citations?hl=en&amp;user=71SLjBMAAAAJ" rel="ugc nofollow noopener">Google scholar</a>, <a href="https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Jiri-Milicka" class="urlextern" target="_blank" title="https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Jiri-Milicka" rel="ugc nofollow noopener">ResearchGate</a></div>
</li>
<li class="level1"><div class="li"><a href="https://www.scopus.com/authid/detail.uri?authorId=55946511400" class="urlextern" target="_blank" title="https://www.scopus.com/authid/detail.uri?authorId=55946511400" rel="ugc nofollow noopener">Scopus</a>, ORCID: <a href="https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8605-1199" class="urlextern" target="_blank" title="https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8605-1199" rel="ugc nofollow noopener">0000-0001-8605-1199</a></div>
</li>
</ul>

<p>
Členství v radách: <a href="https://www.tandfonline.com/toc/njql20/current" class="urlextern" target="_blank" title="https://www.tandfonline.com/toc/njql20/current" rel="ugc nofollow noopener">Journal of Quantitative Linguistics</a>, <a href="https://sciendo.com/journal/LF" class="urlextern" target="_blank" title="https://sciendo.com/journal/LF" rel="ugc nofollow noopener">Linguistic Frontiers</a>
</p>

<p>
Další členství: <a href="https://www.iqla.org/" class="urlextern" target="_blank" title="https://www.iqla.org/" rel="ugc nofollow noopener">The International Quantitative Linguistics Association</a>
</p>

</div>

