</li>
<li class="level1"><div class="li"> Milička, J., Marklová, A., &amp; Cvrček, V. (2025). AI Brown and AI Koditex: LLM-Generated Corpora Comparable to Traditional Corpora of English and Czech Texts. arXiv preprint <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2509.22996" class="urlextern" target="_blank" title="https://arxiv.org/abs/2509.22996" rel="ugc nofollow noopener">https://arxiv.org/abs/2509.22996</a>.  </div>
</li>
